				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741560801,
					"content": "Hello, Dad.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Athos"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560802,
					"content": "...And it's over.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Benoit Leroy"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560803,
					"content": "When Autumn told me you were planning to escape, I was quite surprised. We've kept you locked up for so long, and yet you still haven't completely collapsed or had a breakdown.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Athos"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560804,
					"content": "In fact, you even tried to seize the opportunity to encourage these two \"heroes of justice\" to assist in your escape. I find your will to live quite moving.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Athos"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560805,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560806,
					"content": "But of all the places you could have run off to, in the end, you chose the place you and Autumn used to visit together? What a foolish blunder.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Athos"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560807,
					"content": "I...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Benoit Leroy"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560808,
					"content": "No need to explain. I understand. When people are panicked, they naturally and instinctually tread the path they find most familiar, do they not?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Athos"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560809,
					"content": "Luckily, Autumn left after you. She hasn't made it here yet, and I do not wish to discuss this in front of her.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Athos"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560810,
					"content": "So, just what are you thinking? I truly don't get it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Athos"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560811,
					"content": "Under the guise of marriage, you sold her to others as though she was just a commodity. And you did it twice. The first time, you traded her for a big house in the Court of Fontaine.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Athos"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560812,
					"content": "The second time, you randomly chose someone just to get rid of her, so the property and everything else would be yours alone.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Athos"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560813,
					"content": "When she was bullied and humiliated, you chose to turn a blind eye. She gave you her child from her second marriage to raise...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Athos"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560814,
					"content": "Yet you got rid of her child too. I can only surmise it was so you could take the money meant for the child's support and care.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Athos"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560815,
					"content": "How you can give sweets to the children with a clear conscience and ask them to come around to your home as guests is beyond me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Athos"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560816,
					"content": "Doesn't your conscience twinge even in the slightest? Do you feel even the smallest pang of guilt, even for a moment? I find it completely baffling.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Athos"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560817,
					"content": "To be honest, I only first met Autumn while she was out on the streets. She is a very gentle mother.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Athos"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560818,
					"content": "She cares greatly for my friend's daughter, Penny. If she goes a day without seeing her, little Penny will throw a fit about wanting to see her again.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Athos"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560819,
					"content": "Oh, and if you think you still have a chance to turn the tables, think again. Autumn has a whole lot of friends now — not just me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Athos"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560820,
					"content": "It doesn't matter where you scurry off to. We will chase you to the ends of the earth.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Athos"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560821,
					"content": "Why must a soul like hers be tormented so, and have nothing, while a scoundrel like you lives a life of luxury? Something doesn't seem right about that to me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Athos"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560822,
					"content": "No need to wax philosophical. He isn't worth it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560823
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Morticia"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560823,
					"content": "Ah! It appears you overheard.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560824
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Athos"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560824,
					"content": "Oh, so you're Autumn! Paimon finally has an idea of what's going on. The Leroy family really is complicated!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560825
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560825,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}, we've been following Benoit all the way here, but it turns out a lot of things are completely different from what we imagined.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741560826
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741560826,
					"content": "Now that it's turned out like this, should we still involve ourselves? It's up to you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
